      "mechanisms": {
        "local_revision": "4ac9d51 on codex/cfd-development; existing uncommitted changes retained",
        "definitions": {
          "S": "owner outward area vector",
          "d": "neighbor-center minus owner-center",
          "w": "local neighborWeight; equals 1-gC for a bracketed MOOSE FaceInfo",
          "D": "scalar area/momentum diagonal, held constant in the first isolation experiment",
          "L": "local least-squares pressure gradient",
          "G": "local conservativePressureGradient from reconstructed shared face pressure",
          "T": "|S|²/(S·d)",
          "K": "(S·d)/|d|²"
        },
        "findings": [
          {
            "mechanism": "RC 非正交分解",
            "source": [
              "INSFVRhieChowInterpolator.C:611-618,752-805",
              "MooseVariableFV.C:651-685"
            ],
            "local": [
              "src/fv/FlowFlux2D.cpp:19-20",
              "src/fv/FvMesh2D.cpp:86-94"
            ],
            "math": "相同插值、D_x=D_y=D、G=L、无松弛/时间附加项时：local pressure RC=-D*T*(Δp-Lbar·d)；MOOSE pressure RC=-D*K*(Δp-Lbar·d)。T/K=sec²θ，θ 为 S 与 d 夹角。正交面等价，倾斜面不同。两种分解均可能合理，差异本身不证明缺陷。",
            "hypothesis": "困难圆环若压力缺陷集中在高 θ 面，过强非正交 RC 是待测机制。",
            "minimal_experiment": "只取一个现有圆环网格/冻结场，先常 D，用现有插值计算两种 face pressure RC；按 θ 分组记录绝对差及相邻单元散度。线性 p 应同时接近零；再用二次 p 或已有圆环解析 p。当前只建议，未执行。"
          },
          {
            "mechanism": "动量压力梯度与 compact 压力梯度分离",
            "source": [
              "INSFVMomentumPressure.C:28-45",
              "MooseVariableFV.C:585-614",
